Description:It is your second main phase. You control Kokusho, the Evening Star and have Threaten in hand, with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 5 life and controls their own untapped Kokusho, the Evening Star. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-legend-rule-stolen | The legend rule applies to legendary permanents with the same name that one player controls (CR 704.5j): Threaten the opponent's Kokusho and you must put one of your two into its owner's graveyard; it dies under your control, so its trigger is yours and the opponent loses 5 (CR 603.3a, 603.10a)
